      "text": "```\n              FLOW vs MAP: STABILITY LIVES ON DIFFERENT CURVES\n              ================================================\n        FLOWS x' = f(x)              MAPS x_{n+1} = F(x_n)\n        eigenvalue lambda            multiplier lambda = F'(x*)"
