      "text": "Im                              Im\n            |  UNSTABLE                      | unstable (outside)\n            |                          .-----+-----.\n   ---------+--------> Re             /  |STABLE|   \\\n            |  STABLE                |   |  o   |    |  <- unit circle\n            | (Re < 0)                \\  |unit  |   /   |lambda| < 1 stable\n            |                          '--+--disk+--'\n   stable <=> LEFT half-plane         stable <=> INSIDE unit circle\n   marginal: Re = 0                   marginal: |lambda| = 1\n                                      (lambda=+1 fold, lambda=-1 flip/doubling)\n```"
